# Well-formed, but one entry names a match key this build cannot
# evaluate. Expected: a warning, parsing continues, the whole file
# applies, and the offending entry is force-only.
quirk   needs-a3000
match   machine=a3000 name=fs
because There is no machine-type match key, so this entry can never
        auto-match; it is force-only.
action  downgrade a3000-only-test
status  confirmed

quirk   plain-entry
match   name=fs
because An ordinary entry in the same file, which must still apply.
action  downgrade ordinary-test
status  confirmed
